{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/4576","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/4576/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/4576/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/4576/events","html_url":"https://github.com/cakephp/cakephp/issues/4576","id":42475047,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWU0MjQ3NTA0Nw==","number":4576,"title":"3.0 - TranslateBehavior's association should probably use 'select' instead of 'subquery'","user":{"login":"patrickconroy","id":954577,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1NDU3Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/954577?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrickconroy","html_url":"https://github.com/patrickconroy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrickconroy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrickconroy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrickconroy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrickconroy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrickconroy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrickconroy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrickconroy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrickconroy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrickconroy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":60504544,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw2MDUwNDU0NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/labels/defect","name":"defect","color":"e50f2c","default":false,"description":""}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":{"login":"lorenzo","id":37621,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NjIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37621?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo","html_url":"https://github.com/lorenzo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"assignees":[{"login":"lorenzo","id":37621,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NjIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37621?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo","html_url":"https://github.com/lorenzo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/milestones/7","html_url":"https://github.com/cakephp/cakephp/milestone/7","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/milestones/7/labels","id":453043,"node_id":"MDk6TWlsZXN0b25lNDUzMDQz","number":7,"title":"3.0.0","description":"New major release that breaks compatibility with 2.x\r\n\r\n- PHP5.4.19+\r\n- New ORM & behaviors.\r\n- Improved Routing\r\n- PSR-0 and composer support.\r\n- Simpler configuration and bootstrapping.\r\n- Improved configuration handling.\r\n- Improved bake.\r\n\r\nSee [the roadmap](http://github.com/cakephp/cakephp/wiki/3.0-roadmap) for more details.","creator":null,"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":2464,"state":"closed","created_at":"2013-10-11T20:56:23Z","updated_at":"2015-12-17T03:00:48Z","due_on":"2015-03-22T04:00:00Z","closed_at":"2015-03-23T01:02:41Z"},"comments":5,"created_at":"2014-09-10T23:47:47Z","updated_at":"2014-09-19T14:08:29Z","closed_at":"2014-09-12T16:11:41Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"I'm starting to hook up a 3.0 app into real data and I noticed that TranslateBehavior::113 scans all rows (13830 rows) when it's `subquery` but only the rows I need (10 rows) when it's `select`.\n\nWith `subquery`, the main query and association query are:\n`\nSELECT Posts.id AS `Posts__id`, Posts.name AS `Posts__name`, Posts.permalink AS `Posts__permalink`, Posts.user AS `Posts__user`, Posts.live AS `Posts__live`, Posts.featured_priority AS `Posts__featured_priority`, Posts.date_scheduled AS `Posts__date_scheduled`, Posts.posts_status_id AS `Posts__posts_status_id`, Posts.keywords AS `Posts__keywords`, Posts.comment_count AS `Posts__comment_count`, Posts.posted AS `Posts__posted`, Posts.updated AS `Posts__updated`, Posts.deleted AS `Posts__deleted`, Posts_title_translation.id AS `Posts_title_translation__id`, Posts_title_translation.content AS `Posts_title_translation__content` FROM posts AS Posts LEFT JOIN i18n Posts_title_translation ON (Posts_title_translation.model = 'Posts' AND Posts_title_translation.field = 'title' AND Posts_title_translation.locale = 'en_us' AND Posts.id = (Posts_title_translation.foreign_key)) LIMIT 10;\n`\n\n`\nSELECT i18n.id AS `i18n__id`, i18n.locale AS `i18n__locale`, i18n.model AS `i18n__model`, i18n.foreign_key AS `i18n__foreign_key`, i18n.field AS `i18n__field`, i18n.content AS `i18n__content`, i18n.scope AS `i18n__scope` FROM i18n AS i18n WHERE (i18n.model = 'Posts' AND i18n.foreign_key IN (SELECT Posts.id AS `Posts__id` FROM posts AS Posts));\n`\n\nWhen it's `select` the association query:\n`\nSELECT i18n.id AS `i18n__id`, i18n.locale AS `i18n__locale`, i18n.model AS `i18n__model`, i18n.foreign_key AS `i18n__foreign_key`, i18n.field AS `i18n__field`, i18n.content AS `i18n__content`, i18n.scope AS `i18n__scope` FROM i18n AS i18n WHERE (i18n.model = 'Posts' AND i18n.foreign_key IN (210,222,401,421,431,49001,581,591,10061,10071))\n`\n","closed_by":{"login":"lorenzo","id":37621,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NjIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37621?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo","html_url":"https://github.com/lorenzo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/4576/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/4576/